---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About — Theoria"
	description="About Theoria, journal of the Serbian Philosophical Society"
	lang="en"
>
	<main class="container">
		<section class="heading">
			<p class="label">THEORIA</p>
			<h1>About</h1>

			<p class="lead">
				<em>Theoria</em> is the philosophical journal of the Serbian
				Philosophical Society, publishing original scholarly work
				across philosophical fields and traditions.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="identifiers">
			<div>
				<p class="label">ISSN · PRINT</p>
				<p class="value">0351-2274</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<p class="label">ISSN · ONLINE</p>
				<p class="value">2406-081X</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<p class="label">COBISS.SR-ID</p>
				<p class="value">556303</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div>
				<p class="label">HISTORY</p>
			</div>

			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					Following a two-year interruption in the publication of
					<em>Filosofija</em>, an extraordinary assembly of the
					Philosophical Society of Serbia, held on 9 May 1976,
					elected a new publishing council, editorial board and
					Editor-in-Chief. It was then decided that the new journal
					would be titled <em>Theoria</em>. Its first Editor-in-Chief
					and responsible editor was Aleksandar Kron.
				</p>

				<p>
					Since 1976, <em>Theoria</em> has been published without
					interruption. Initially it appeared twice a year as a
					double issue; by the early 1980s it had moved to four
					issues annually.
				</p>

				<p>
					From 1991 onward, <em>Theoria</em> has been a philosophical
					journal in the strict sense. Over its history it has
					published original scholarly articles, translations,
					reviews and critical discussions while remaining open to
					different philosophical schools and approaches.
				</p>

				<p>
					In 2026, <em>Theoria</em> marks fifty years of continuous
					publication.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div>
				<p class="label">EDITOR-IN-CHIEF</p>
			</div>

			<div class="prose">
				<h2>Aleksandra Zorić</h2>

				<p>
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<a href="mailto:theoria.redakcija@gmail.com">
						theoria.redakcija@gmail.com
					</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div>
				<p class="label">EDITORIAL BOARD</p>
			</div>

			<div class="board">
				<p>
					<strong>Nebojša Grubor</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Aleksandar Dobrijević</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Una Popović</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Novi Sad
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Predrag Milidrag</strong><br />
					Institute of Social Sciences, Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Goran Rujević</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Novi Sad
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Mašan Bogdanovski</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Radmila Jovanović Kozlovski</strong><br />
					Faculty of Philosophy, University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Višnja Knežević</strong><br />
					Institute for Philosophy, Faculty of Philosophy,
					University of Belgrade
				</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Neven Cvetićanin</strong><br />
					Institute of Social Sciences, Belgrade
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.container {
		width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.heading {
		padding: 90px 0 70px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #bcb7ac;
	}

	.label {
		margin: 0 0 22px;
		font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.17em;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
		line-height: 0.95;
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.lead {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 35px 0 0;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.identifiers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		border-bottom: 1px solid #bcb7ac;
	}

	.identifiers > div {
		padding: 36px 30px 36px 0;
	}

	.identifiers > div + div {
		padding-left: 30px;
		border-left: 1px solid #bcb7ac;
	}

	.value {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
	}

	.section {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
		gap: 60px;
		padding: 65px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #bcb7ac;
	}

	.prose {
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.prose p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.prose h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.prose a {
		color: inherit;
	}

	.board {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 0 50px;
	}

	.board p {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 20px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #c9c4ba;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.identifiers,
		.board {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.identifiers > div,
		.identifiers > div + div {
			padding: 28px 0;
			border-left: 0;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #bcb7ac;
		}

		.section {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 25px;
		}
	}
</style>